It appears that for DEC, processor speedy and graphics performance are 
nearly independent.

DEC appears to have essentially two levels of 3-D graphics performance 
that differ by about 15%.  However, the lowest-cost and highest-cost 
systems differ in price by almost 150%!

The tests are as follows:  

pcb:      "pc_board"     2-D vectors
chassis:  "sys_chassis"  3-D vectors
cyl:      "cyl_head"     3-D solid
head:     "head"         3-D mesh-strip triangles
shuttle:  "shuttle"      3-D simulation, "virtual reality"


